From 90944e30aefdf6d2ae9acca92d288979b7c140ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GrgaPalcic <26028466+GrgaPalcic@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:30:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] glm cuda: TF_GLM_KV_LIVE_HALF=1 keeps the live half of the
 KDA state in a kept prompt state

Ported from upstream 7547c99c2 (PR #2181). Opt-in, off by default; the ranks' fingerprint layout carries it (18). Host-tested. Beside --learn-conversations it is refused at open (0131): neither disk identity carries the flag.
